# Architecture Sync Enforcement

When you make **structural changes** (new features, services, models, navigation,
AppStyle tokens, shared components, utilities, tests), update
`.claude/references/architecture-documentation.md` before reporting done.

For the full trigger map (which change updates which section), see the
`reviewing-code-changes` skill, section "Architecture Sync".

The stop hook (`post-task-check.sh` Check 2) verifies `architecture-documentation.md` was
updated when structural changes are detected.
